==History==
2016 
*The Lumberjack [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 4/7/2016, in the [[Version History#Tournaments Update (4/7/2016)|Tournaments Update]].
*On 24/8/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (24/8/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Lumberjack's speed to 120 (from 90), now classified as Very Fast, decreased his attack time interval to 0.7 seconds (from 1.1 seconds), and decreased his damage by 23%.
*On 19/9/2016, the [[Version History#September 2016 Update (19/9/2016)|September 2016 Update]], decreased the [[Rage]]'s attack speed boost to 30% (from 40%) and its duration to 6 seconds (from 8 seconds).
*On 1/11/2016, the [[Version History#November 2016 Update (1/11/2016)|November 2016 Update]], increased the Rage's attack speed boost to 35% (from 30%).
*On 15/12/2016, the [[Version History#December 2016 Update (15/12/2016)|December 2016 Update]], increased the Lumberjack's hitpoints by 6%.
2017
*On 13/3/2017, the [[Version History#March 2017 Update (13/3/2017)|March 2017 Update]], increased the Rage's Level such that a [[Tournament|Tournament Standard]] Lumberjack drops a Tournament Standard Rage, a maxed Lumberjack drops a maxed Rage, etc.
*On 19/4/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/4/2017)|Balance Update]], increased the Lumberjack's hitpoints by 4%.
2018
*On 24/1/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (24/1/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Lumberjack´s hitpoints by 7%.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Legendary}} cards start at Level 9 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 5).
*On 24/10/2018, a maintenance break, slightly changed the Lumberjack's card description. Its new description is now this: "''He chops trees by day and hunts The Log by night. His bottle of Rage spills everywhere when he dies.''"
*On 5/12/2018, the [[Version History#December%202018%20Update%20(5/12/2018)|December 2018 Update]], reverted the Lumberjack's card description to its state before 24/10/2018.
2019
*On 5/8/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/8/2019)|Balance Update]], increased the Lumberjack's attack time interval to 0.8 seconds (from 0.7 seconds).
2020
*On 4/12/2020, a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(4/12/2020)|maintenance break]], added a card render to the Lumberjack's card info screen.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Lumberjack from Frozen Peak to Serenity Peak.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 12/12/2022, the [[Version History#Clashmas%20Update%20(12/12/2022)|Clashmas Update]], set the Rage's duration to 6 seconds for every level and made the [[:Category:Spell Cards|spell]] deal area damage. In addition, its area radius was decreased to 3 tiles (from 5 tiles), and added a 0.5 second deploy timer to Rage.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Rage’s duration to 5.5 seconds (from 6 seconds) and increased the Lumberjack’s damage by 6%.
*On 3/2/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (3/2/2025)|Febuary 2025 Update]], added the Lumberjack's Evolution.
*On 11/2/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (11/2/2025)|maintenance break]], made it so that Lumberjack Ghost's lifetime is no longer affected by Rage.
*On 4/3/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/3/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Rage's duration after leaving the radius to 1 second (from 2 seconds).
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], allowed the [[Executioner]] and [[Ram Rider]] to be affected by Rage.
*On 9/4/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/4/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Rage's damage by 23%.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] increased the Rage's damage by 21%.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]] decreased the Rage's speed boost to 30% (from 35%).

